verimg": "engenn8le05ob09re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le05ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le05ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le05ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tSo, Jose, how is everything? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tEverything's good, Vanessa. It's been a very busy first week, but I'm getting the hang of it. I'm looking forward to the weekend, though.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tI'm sure you are. Are you happy with your accommodation? Does it live up to your expectations?"}, {"time": "16000", "image": "engenn8le05ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tYes, it's ok. It's not cheap, but it's very practical. I'm sharing a house with 3 other students. It's not very common to do that in Colombia, but here people do it a lot. I'm happy because I have enough personal space. I don't really see my roommates, so the house is very quiet. I miss my home, though.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tWhy's that?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tLife is more communal back home. We spend a lot of time with family. For example, lunch is the most important meal of the day. It is not uncommon to spend two hours away from work just to have lunch at home and spend time with your loved ones. It feels like people lead isolated lives here."}, {"time": "56800", "image": "engenn8le05ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tWow. I guess that's a big change for you, then. We basically do away with having a lunch break altogether during the week here. People don't have time for it. They always find an excuse not to have lunch. Fortunately, we can fall back on our own meals at the restaurant!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tThat's true. Lunch is not something I like to miss!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tSpeaking of which, let's see what Chef Bruce has in store for us!"}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}]}], "type": "sena"}